@startuml System_Overview_Activity_Diagram
!theme plain
title Thesis Management System - Overall Activity Flow
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1976D2
  FontColor #0D47A1
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3E0
  DiamondBorderColor #F57C00
}

|#LightBlue|Admin|
start
:System Initialization;
:Configure Areas of Interest;
:Sync Supervisors from API;
:Manage Batches;
:Monitor System Performance;

|#LightGreen|Advisor|
:Create Student Groups;
:Assign Students to Groups;
:Set Areas of Interest;
:Run Supervisor Assignment Lottery;
note right
  Assignment Modes:
  - AOI Matching
  - Ranking Priority
  - Combined Mode
end note

|#LightYellow|Supervisor|
:Receive Group Assignment;
:Schedule Meetings;
:Review Report Submissions;
fork
  :Annotate Reports;
fork again
  :Provide Feedback;
end fork
:Finalize Reports;

|#LightPink|Student|
:Join Assigned Group;
:Attend Meetings;
:Submit Reports;
:View Annotations;
:Receive Feedback;
:Revise & Resubmit;

|#LightGray|Panel Member|
:Review Final Reports;
:Provide Evaluation;
:Submit Grades;

|Admin|
:Generate Final Reports;
:Archive Data;
stop

@enduml